{"id":2766,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为提升研究生的科研创新能力，加强学术规范。我院于12月26日上午在学院701会议室举办第21届研究生科技立项答辩活动，本次答辩特邀专业教师组成评审团进行评议与指导。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Znm7bsM7r7Ml-4LEmQknRf7LzUDM7refMzl4o7UsUmvYMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRLSysLkhVUz7Pol74MllsMz7ZM4LaoR7ZoR78nR-8nRrFoRffoRV7U8MFLlCDolCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CaozlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6095&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EC170EA119A35E7518730818814D24D5/80A81DCC/1F69F\" vheight=\"226.07000732421875\" vwidth=\"302.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Znm7bsM7r7Ml-4LEmQknRf7LzUDM7refMzl4o7UsUmvYMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRLSysLkhVUz7Pol74MllsMz7ZM4LaoR7ZoR78nR-8nRrFoRffoRV7U8MFLlCDolCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CaozlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6095&e=.jpg\"></p><p>答辩过程中，各课题申报人围绕项目的研究背景、思路方法、创新点及预期成果进行系统陈述。评审教师从课题的学术价值、可行性及技术路线等方面进行细致点评，提出宝贵的建设性意见。</p><p>此次答辩活动不仅为同学们提供了展示科研能力的平台，也对后续课题的高质量开展起到积极地推动作用，将进一步助力我院研究生培养质量的持续提升。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Znm7bsM7r7Ml-4LEmQknRf7LzUDM7refMzl4o7UsUmvYMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRLSysLkhVUz7Pol74MllsMz7ZM4LaoR7ZoR78nR-8nRrFoRffoRV7U8MFLlCDolCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CaozlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6095&e=.jpg"}